<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>转场</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)"}}>13 / 45</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 600, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 80px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 500, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: "center"}}>前两层改不了「能不能上线」，后两层只放大结果</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 8, marginTop: 30, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", textAlign: "center", lineHeight: 1.55}}>所以问题落回中间那一层。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", textAlign: "center", lineHeight: 1.55}}>这是本场的推断，不是行业共识。</Text></Box></Box></Box>
